    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "reconnect? there's nothing to reconnect to. that person is just... deleted. it's not even about being lonely, it's more like the space I occupied is just empty now. everything feels so hollow. i'm just going through the motions, but it feels more like i'm just waiting for the inevitable end of the simulation. does that even make sense? it just feels like there's no point in keeping the charade going.",
